<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάπη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scum</i> which forms on the surface of wine, vinegar,
			or other liquids left to stand, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάμπη</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1073a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.704
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Syn.</u>
				9.13.2
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπῶδες</span></b> , of urine, <i>with a scum on it</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				182
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.92
			</span></i>; but Erot.read <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαπῶδες</span></b> , and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαππώδης</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ
		τοῦ</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
